    "e.g. Locked door - need a key": "",
    "not needed by anyone": "",
    "{Automap} shows the map, drawn as you explore; {Note} writes a note on it. {Search} searches for secret doors. Dungeons are dark: a lantern, a torch or the Glowlight spell lets the party see further.": "",
    "{Characters} opens the character sheets: equip what you found, pass items to whoever can use them, and read scrolls. Shops buy what nobody needs.": "",
    "{Journal} opens the journal: every quest you've heard of and what to do next. Its \"Where next\" goal is marked on the maps ({Automap}), so you need never be lost.": "",
    "{QuickSave} saves and {QuickLoad} loads the quick save. The game also saves by itself on entering a new area and before a boss, and {Menu} has the full save and load screens.": "",
    "{Rest} rests for eight hours: everyone heals and casters regain spell points, and each hero eats one food. Monsters may interrupt a rest in the wild - the inn is safer. Clerics can heal between fights with {Cast}.": "",
